{"event_type":"review","id":"e9ddf22b62e6ac90903fe8134643e2ebff85cbc8a7162a3a8a45b76b75056707","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T19:44:08Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5b5850c040d8a514ed0765ec4a50d787158a64daa6107ca5d713eacbc7982e04","sha256":"5b5850c040d8a514ed0765ec4a50d787158a64daa6107ca5d713eacbc7982e04"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1f3c23329e97119a55118098cb070fe4c4df9b689cfead42300dca6f4fc754a9","sha256":"1f3c23329e97119a55118098cb070fe4c4df9b689cfead42300dca6f4fc754a9"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e4c8c99be7baf3ee0f6ee729125b05bcf64de07d56c6efef9840c80a0a9a2b78","sha256":"e4c8c99be7baf3ee0f6ee729125b05bcf64de07d56c6efef9840c80a0a9a2b78"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/763fb3c649d9e21b1e285005b346606fb16071c16c951901fffa137c6ae89bcd","sha256":"763fb3c649d9e21b1e285005b346606fb16071c16c951901fffa137c6ae89bcd"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/be3005c17f4af08cdfd3a690528596c5bda1ceb7e510e58e11b35177a70e31b0","sha256":"be3005c17f4af08cdfd3a690528596c5bda1ceb7e510e58e11b35177a70e31b0"}],"attempt_id":"a14fc18427e57d5b48681c21527213af80481a71453e7effdd457955a51b2daa:0:1","base":"064923e79bedeb63d6a32658657b9c57aa793260","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"deacb424eb753d21b787101449f33478b1b9e522","body":"**Catch rejection from `tool.execute` to keep the surface denial-only.**\n\n`src/harness/surface.ts:316`: `tool.execute` is awaited with no guard. If an executor rejects, `call` rejects instead of returning a denial. The path instructions say \"Executors never throw: every refusal ... is a structured denial\". The `HarnessSurface.call` doc (Line 241) also promises that only an unserved name throws.\n\nThe queue itself survives, because Line 320 catches the rejection. The caller still receives a raw rejection. The subprocess fold cannot classify that rejection as a harness denial. `TOOL_FAILURE_KINDS` already defines `EXECUTION_ERROR` for this case.\n\nThis is a defensive guard against a violated executor contract. Confirm that the guard is acceptable at this boundary.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-            : await tool.execute(args, opts);\n+            : await tool.execute(args, opts).catch(\n+                (err: unknown): ToolkitToolResult => ({\n+                  ok: false,\n+                  denial: {\n+                    tool: tool.name,\n+                    reason: `EXECUTION_ERROR: ${err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err)}`,\n+                  },\n+                }),\n+              );\n```\n</details>","id":"03c754daf1df72a24f9f48f7aa7b485cd756131d98e98ab15814acd31f6b43c0","intervals":[],"path":"src/harness/surface.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Catch rejection from `tool.execute` to keep the surface denial-only."}],"head":"635120b8b198d67e0bacc5ebffddf083e3228050","head_tree":"067d49da10942551a3c39da201ad1d79467f9afa","input_scope":[{"blob":"deacb424eb753d21b787101449f33478b1b9e522","intervals":[[1,458]],"path":"src/harness/surface.ts"}],"job_id":"a14fc18427e57d5b48681c21527213af80481a71453e7effdd457955a51b2daa:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"deacb424eb753d21b787101449f33478b1b9e522","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/harness/surface.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"deacb424eb753d21b787101449f33478b1b9e522","intervals":[[56,56],[207,207]],"path":"src/harness/surface.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"deacb424eb753d21b787101449f33478b1b9e522","intervals":[[5